    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_926_1#10$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't bother trying to change my mind, Cl\u00e9ment.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gerald"
    },
    {
        "text": "I can't go, and I won't go.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gerald"
    },
    {
        "text": "I never told you my old name. It's not a past I'm proud of. An infamous deserter, a broken man.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gerald"
    },
    {
        "text": "With me here, they have an excuse to harm the others.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gerald"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_926_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't be so sad. I'm just going to see Eileen. Death is familiar enough to me, I used to trade in death.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gerald"
    },
    {
        "text": "My life is a small price to pay for the lives of all the others.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gerald"
    },
    {
        "text": "And don't worry about the ones left behind. They'll follow my order.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gerald"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_926_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Raimund is young. He might be impetuous. Do try to calm him down, won't you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gerald"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_926_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gerald"
    },
    {
        "text": "Finally...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gerald"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_926_1#4$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Tell Stefano that we probably shouldn't have stopped, back when we were wandering the wastes. Maybe we shouldn't have tried to stay.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gerald"
    },
    {
        "text": "But this place was too good.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gerald"
    },
    {
        "text": "It was like a dream, living together for so many years. Sooner or later, though, we all have to wake up.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gerald"
    },
    {
        "text": "Tell Stefano... gratias, and me paenitet.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gerald"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll leave the rest to you, Cl\u00e9ment.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gerald"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_926_1#4$1",
        "afrom": 1,
        "ato": 0,
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "text": "Here, at the end of it all...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gerald"
    },
    {
        "text": "Am I a hunter, or am I still that mercenary?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gerald"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm sorry, Eileen. I don't suppose you'd like what I've become, what I look like now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gerald"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
