    },
    {
        "text": "Federico Giallo stands alone in the morning light of the sacrarium."
    },
    {
        "text": "The marks left behind by the flames have already been scrubbed away. Deprived of its furnishings, the sacrarium feels empty, with only the sound of footsteps to fill it."
    },
    {
        "text": "Federico is an outstanding Executor. He has been with the Notarial Hall for six years, carrying out his duties with excellence."
    },
    {
        "text": "But this is his first year as a saint. There is no one to guide him or instruct him."
    },
    {
        "text": "The silent saint picks up the broken and burned flower."
    },
    {
        "text": "The statue protected it from the flames. It was a miracle that it survived the fire."
    },
    {
        "text": "But this miracle is worthless in the eyes of another."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "The flower is still here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Federico"
    },
    {
        "text": "But it is not the one he wanted?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Federico"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wounds beyond repair...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Federico"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't understand.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Federico"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Federico"
    },
    {
        "text": "Would Laterano still be Laterano?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Federico"
    },
    {
        "text": "............",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Federico"
    },
    {
        "text": "Insufficient data to reach a conclusion.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Federico"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Executor Federico realizes with a start\u2014"
    },
    {
        "text": "Cl\u00e9ment's expression was too calm."
    },
    {
        "text": "He did not mention Gerald's death, nor the arrangements of the other Sarkaz."
    },
    {
        "text": "What about himself?"
    },
    {
        "text": "Words without action have no power. That is why he did not say he would find out the truth."
    },
    {
        "text": "Nor did he say he would fulfill Gerald's last request."
    },
    {
        "text": "Federico gazes at the broken flower before his eyes."
    },
    {
        "text": "He has a feeling\u2014"
    },
    {
        "text": "A feeling that, someday, he will find the answer to all his questions in this flower."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
