    {
        "text": "Mm\u2014uh\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Erendel"
    },
    {
        "text": "Morning, Sara... it's time to wake up...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Erendel"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mm... mmm... zzz...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Erendel"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_929_1#8$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Eren! Wake up, Eren!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Estara"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mamma came back yesterday!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Estara"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_929_1#8$1",
        "focus": "all"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.2
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_clothmovementsp",
        "volume": 0.8
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_928_1#4$1",
        "posfrom": "0,-50",
        "posto": "0,0",
        "duration": 0.8,
        "isblock": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_928_1#4$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Erendel"
    },
    {
        "text": "She came back? Where is she?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Erendel"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_929_1#8$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "It must be her! Look\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Estara"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_cloakmovement",
        "volume": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_928_1#4$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "A new blanket from Mamma? It's a little torn...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Erendel"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_928_1#3$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "But there are pictures of circles on it! And people with wings! Like what Mamma promised us!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Erendel"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_929_1#3$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Who cares if it's a little torn? Mamma's clothes are torn too. We have to be good.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Estara"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_928_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I know, I know.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Erendel"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let's go and find Senior Federico!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Erendel"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_929_1#8$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Can we play with Senior Federico today?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Estara"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_928_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, silly, we're going to tell Senior Federico that Mamma came back to see us last night, so he doesn't need to worry!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Erendel"
    },
